@startuml random_question_sequence
title Sequence Diagram - Random Question in Test

actor Student
participant TestController
participant TestService
participant QuestionRepository
participant ScoringStrategy
entity "Question" as question
database DB

Student -> TestController: POST /api/tests/{id}/submit

TestController -> TestService: submitTest(user_id, test_id, answers)

TestService -> QuestionRepository: getQuestions(test_id)
QuestionRepository -> DB: SELECT questions
DB --> QuestionRepository: questions
QuestionRepository -> question: Khởi tạo đối tượng (Map)
question --> QuestionRepository: Đối tượng Question
QuestionRepository --> TestService: questions

TestService -> TestService: randomizeQuestions(questions)

loop for each question
    TestService -> ScoringStrategy: checkAnswer(randomized_question, answer)
    ScoringStrategy --> TestService: score
    TestService -> QuestionRepository: saveAnswer(attempt_id, question_id, answer, score)
    QuestionRepository -> question: Khởi tạo/Gán dữ liệu

    QuestionRepository -> DB: INSERT test_answers
end

TestService --> TestController: result
TestController --> Student: {score, details}

@enduml
